# n8n Workflow Master Architecture

This document serves as the absolute source of truth for the n8n automation workflows connected to the OmniDimension Voice Agent. 

> **AI SYSTEM RULE**: Whenever you (the AI) update, patch, or suggest changes to the n8n workflow, you MUST update this file to reflect the new architecture.

## 1. Post-Call Webhook (`/webhook/omnidim-post-call`)
Triggered automatically by OmniDimension when a voice call ends.
- **Payload Source:** OmniDimension native post-call payload.
- **Key Logic:**
  - Extracts variables: `customer_name`, `preferred_date_time`, `service_requested`, `complaint_details`.
  - **Google Sheets Node:** Maps variables to columns. Must use fallbacks (e.g. `{{ $json.body.call_report?.extracted_variables?.customer_name || 'N/A' }}`) to prevent crashes on empty general enquiries.
  - **Handoff Switch:** If `$json.body.summary` contains "HANDOFF", routes to the Meta API WhatsApp Alert node.

## 2. Text Chat Alert Webhook (`/webhook/omnidim-manager-alert`)
Triggered explicitly via a Custom Tool by the AI when a user is angry on Text Chat.
- **Payload Source:** Custom Tool `manager_alert`.
- **Key Logic:**
  - Sends a WhatsApp template message to the Manager using the Meta API.
  - Returns a success JSON to OmniDimension so the AI can confirm the escalation to the user.

## 3. Calendar Webhook (`/webhook/omnidim-calendar-tool`)
Handles bidirectional calendar sync for the AI.
- **Route 1: `check_slots`**
  - Uses `Get Events` Google Calendar node to pull today's events.
  - **Calculate Free Slots (Code Node):** Parses ISO strings, subtracts busy times from a master list (e.g., 9:00 AM, 10:30 AM, 2:00 PM), and outputs only truly free slots.
  - Returns `{{ $json.slots }}` to the AI.
- **Route 2: `book`**
  - Uses `Create Event` Google Calendar node to push the appointment.
  - Returns success confirmation to the AI.

## 4. Text Chat Summary Webhook (`/webhook/omnidim-text-summary`)
Triggered automatically by OmniDimension when a text chat session ends.
- **Payload Source:** OmniDimension native post-chat payload.
- **Key Logic:**
  - Formats the chat summary and logs it to Google Sheets.
